  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multinational - Legal Advisory Services for East Africa Submarine Cable System (Eassy) Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Multinational - Services de conseil juridique pour le projet de syst&#xe8;me de c&#xe2;ble sous-marin d&apos;Afrique de l&apos;Est (Eassy)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to support the Private Sector Department at the AfDB and the other participating DFIs to engage the services of a legal advisor to finalise all legal matters necessary for smooth implementation and preparation of the Special Purpose Vehicle (SPV) of the East Africa Submarine Cable System (EASSy) project.</narrative>
  </description>
